# reader.expected -- what clauses.pl must make of selftest/reader.pl.
#
# offset  line  col  len  name  arity  kind
#
# Regenerate deliberately, never casually:
#   printf '%s\\n' "$PWD/tools/coco-agent/selftest/reader.pl" > /tmp/f
#   COCO_CC_FILES=/tmp/f ./cocolog --local run tools/coco-agent/clauses.pl cc_dump
#
# A change here is a change in what a clause IS, and every row was
# hand-checked when it was written. `rd_it''s' keeps its doubled quote:
# the reader records the name as written, which is what the blocklist is
# keyed on, and is a known limit rather than an accident.
